                                                "sense_id": "e36b491d-ab9e-3c82-a791-136f2deb3a40",
                                                "text": "Denmark coach Morten Olsen's pre-match warning that the Netherlands were simply better than his side could easily have been dismissed as mind games."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13920326-1edf-4e33-8783-15aeee2e12ab",
